{"id":"vod_bf_151522","vodId":"151522","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"二十世纪电气目录","name_cn":"二十世纪电气目录","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260705-1/b85d5a92d3ca8cf2f0827fe432817374.webp"},"summary":"故事发生在明治四十年（1907 年）在京都伏见居住的百川稻子什么都不擅长，每天都被父亲责骂，对于她来说的救赎就是祈祷神佛，某天一如往常她前往伏见稻荷神社参拜神明，遇到了一位自由奔放的少年坂本喜八，坂本喜八对稻子说不要信这些看不见的东西，从今之后将是电气时代。而此时稻子的 父亲对稻子说了关于结婚的事情，而且是父亲单方面决定的，稻子本来是放弃抵抗认为自己的价值就是如此，但坂本喜八打开了稻子想要离开这个家的心声，带着稻子离开了这个封闭的家。阻止结婚的方法是找出奇书《二十世纪电气目录》，那是喜八童年时代写下的关于电气的预言书，而喜八过去的哥哥清六带走这本书之后下落不明，喜八和稻子为了寻找这本奇书在京都和滋贺等地逃窜，消失的“电气目录”和其背后隐藏的秘密都等待揭开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-29 11:22:33","episodeCount":13,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/1146d2d5c026/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/daef5cd33d3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/75b59695ad16/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/b2c26f750698/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/9a8ba5fefc44/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/b4850bd2fb27/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/6ba74bbdb05a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/e2c7aa8fc94a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/72b4e6cc2ab3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/8d11cd029849/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/fcad8b76387c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/ershishijidianqimulu/ca4533a5a930/index.